# Optional. The avatar app publishes the bus address and token in
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\avelyn\runtime.json and this package reads them from there;
# set these only to point somewhere else (tests, development).
# AVATAR_BUS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:47903
# AVATAR_BUS_TOKEN=
# Optional — defaults to ../memory/data/avelyn.db relative to this package.
# Only set this to an absolute path if you need the DB somewhere else.
# MEMORY_DB_PATH=

# Optional — VOICEVOX defaults to http://127.0.0.1:50021 and speaker id 14 (冥鳴ひまり).
# The engine must already be running locally; see voice/README.md.
# VOICEVOX_URL=
# VOICEVOX_SPEAKER_ID=
